              visible: WITHD,
              highlighted: ["D"] },
            { text: "Therefore no number which is greater than {D} measures the numbers {A}, {B}, and {C}.",
              visible: WITHD,
              highlighted: ["D","A","B","C"] },
            { text: "Therefore {D} is the greatest common measure of {A}, {B}, and {C}.",
